# Peace-period PvP rule (ui_texts 5195 "you cannot attack other players during a peace period",
# owner recollection 2026-11-10): in a zone group whose conflict state is Peace (7) a player
# cannot harm another player, even though their factions are hostile. Setting the group to
# Conflict (5) restores the attack.
#
# Zone group 14 is `e_steppe_belt` (zone keys 136 / 247); both bots teleport near the Steppe
# Belt Mirage Isle portal at 26244.9, 6397.2, 397.9. The peace assertion is self-checking: if
# the bots are not in group 14, no rule applies and the victim's HP drops in the Peace window.
#
# The victim `gm heal`s itself (it targets itself) before the attacker starts: expecthpdrop /
# expectnohpdrop compare against the last SCUnitPointsPacket, and the server sends none at spawn.
#
# Bots:
#   attacker  GM: faction 101 (Nuia), sets the zone state and attacks
#   victim    GM: faction 109 (Haranya), the hostile target; it checks its own HP

suite peace-pvp
bot attacker gm
bot victim gm

[attacker]
tp 26230 6420 390
targetself
gm setfaction 101
gm pos
waitpeer 120 ${victim}
sync pos 2
gm zonestate PEACE 14
gm pos
sync peace 2
sync before_peace 2
pump 1
nattack 2 ${victim}
sync attacked_peace 2
gm zonestate CONFLICT 14
sync conflict 2
pump 1
nattack 2 ${victim}
sync done 2

[victim]
tp 26235 6425 390
targetself
gm setfaction 109
gm pos
waitpeer 120 ${attacker}
sync pos 2
sync peace 2
gm heal
sync before_peace 2
expectnohpdrop self 8
sync attacked_peace 2
sync conflict 2
expecthpdrop self 20
sync done 2
